@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Contact Role API Permissioning
	Testing Koroneiki Contact Role API Permissioning functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the contact roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Default Account Role  |
	| Optional Account Role |

Scenario: Create contact role attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki account contact roles that are attempted to get created by non permissioned users should not get created.

	Given I attempt to create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role"

Scenario: View contact role attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki account contact roles should not be viewable by non permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Update contact role attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki account contact roles that are attempted to get updated by non permissioned users should not get updated.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I attempt to update a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role" to have the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Optional Account Role"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Delete contact role attempt by non permissioned user
	Koroneiki account contact roles should not be removable by non permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I attempt to delete a contact role on koroneiki with the name "Default Account Role" as a non permissioned user
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role" and the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact role with the name "Default Account Role" as a non permissioned user